nd others for legislation to reduce filing fees for certain limited liability companies.  Economic Development and Emerging Technologies.","DocumentText":"\tSection 12 of chapter 156C of the General Laws, as so appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 43 and 44, the words \"five hundred dollars\" and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- $250.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J12","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J12"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}